{"id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-configuration-graph.md","title":"Configuration Graph","display":"df-configuration-graph — Configuration Graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-configuration]]","[[28-df-configuration-transition]]"],"display":"df-configuration-graph — Configuration Graph","label":"28-df-configuration-graph","aliases":["28-df-configuration-graph"],"type":"definition","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"80–81","source_pdf_pages":"106–107"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-configuration-graph — Configuration Graph"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-configuration-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-configuration-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"80–81"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"106–107"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=k_M\">\\(k=k_M\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=s(|x|)\">\\(b=s(|x|)\\)</span>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),\\operatorname{Step}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),\\operatorname{Step}_M\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599727eea07e91d7\" href=\"?note=599727eea07e91d7\" title=\"28-df-configuration\">28-df-configuration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b648ff230619ba2\" href=\"?note=6b648ff230619ba2\" title=\"28-df-configuration-transition\">28-df-configuration-transition</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol b=(b_1,\\ldots,b_k)\">\\(\\boldsymbol b=(b_1,\\ldots,b_k)\\)</span> 为每带可访问初始区间长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}V_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\mid\\exists\\boldsymbol b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}^k\\;(&amp;\\sum_{j=1}^k b_j\\le b\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i_j&lt;b_j\\land\\forall a\\ge b_j\\;T_j(a)=\\sqcup))\\},\\\\\nE_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in V_{M,x,s}^2\\mid\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C&#39;)\\},\\qquad G_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq(V_{M,x,s},E_{M,x,s}).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}V_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\mid\\exists\\boldsymbol b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}^k\\;(&amp;\\sum_{j=1}^k b_j\\le b\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i_j&lt;b_j\\land\\forall a\\ge b_j\\;T_j(a)=\\sqcup))\\},\\\\\nE_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq\\{(C,C&#39;)\\in V_{M,x,s}^2\\mid\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C&#39;)\\},\\qquad G_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq(V_{M,x,s},E_{M,x,s}).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>旧定义只界定非空白格数，却允许格坐标及磁头任意远，因此图可以无限。现在输入固定、工作内容和工作头限制在有界初始区间，顶点有限。这个图用于可达性；单条边不会自行认证一条路径累计访问的总空间，严格空间预算也可把各带高水位加入状态。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§4.1.1，印刷 pp.80–81 / PDF pp.106–107。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-configuration-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration","status":"resolved","id":"599727eea07e91d7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$k=k_M$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$b=s(|x|)$。\n$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]；$\\boldsymbol b=(b_1,\\ldots,b_k)$ 为每带可访问初始区间长度。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-configuration-transition","status":"resolved","id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$k=k_M$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$b=s(|x|)$。\n$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]；$\\boldsymbol b=(b_1,\\ldots,b_k)$ 为每带可访问初始区间长度。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"k=k_M","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"b=s(|x|)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),\\operatorname{Step}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol b=(b_1,\\ldots,b_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}V_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\mid\\exists\\boldsymbol b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}^k\\;(&\\sum_{j=1}^k b_j\\le b\\\\&\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(i_j<b_j\\land\\forall a\\ge b_j\\;T_j(a)=\\sqcup))\\},\\\\\nE_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq\\{(C,C')\\in V_{M,x,s}^2\\mid\\operatorname{Step}_M(C,C')\\},\\qquad G_{M,x,s}\\coloneqq(V_{M,x,s},E_{M,x,s}).\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1734,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语言与停机语义：[[28-df-language]]、[[28-df-decider]]、[[28-df-recognizer]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-configuration-graph]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"},{"id":"7aa09fd33f1203a2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8380a071500296f8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"58e742656f0db590","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e244e427679f34a1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ed20d679e3199320","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["599727eea07e91d7","6b648ff230619ba2"]}